1. systemctl start <servicename> => to start a service
2. systemctl stop <servicename> => to stop a service
3. systemctl restart <servicename> => to restart a service
4. systemctl reload <servicname> => to reload a service
5. systemctl enable <serivcename> => start serivce with os
6. systemctl disable <servicename> => don't start service with os
7. systemctl status <servicename> => to see if serivce is running/stopped 



ansible-playbook -i <inventory> <playbook file>
ansible-doc <modulename>
